    "description": "让 dsh 会办事:登录态真实浏览器 × 180 站点结构化命令 + SystemOne 亚秒决策 + 执行真实性判定 + watch 监控。Logged-in browser automation for DeepSeek Harness: 180-site structured commands, sub-second decisions, action-evidence verification."
